schema ProtocolContract
generation protocol-1
authority engine/core/src/protocol_contract.c
absorbs components/BonfyreControlPlane/protocol_contract.py

field role
  type record
  role information-participant
  required true

field requires
  type set[text]
  role input-parameters

field produces
  type set[text]
  role output-parameters

field evidence_required
  type set[text]
  role standing-evidence-claims

invariant order-is-derived
  statement waves are derived from information availability and do not declare carrier message order

invariant obligations-have-one-owner
  statement enactment opens commitments through CommitmentGraph and holds no second protocol obligation store

invariant closure-has-two-axes
  statement an enactment is closed only when CommitmentGraph reports no outstanding obligations and every evidence_required claim stands in EvidenceGraph

forbidden_inference conformant contract -> authorized enactment
forbidden_inference completed enactment -> discharged commitment
forbidden_inference standing evidence -> proof frontier crossed
